  "Solution": "\\(0.7 = 7/10\\). Each \\(0.1\\) is one tenth, so seven tenths contains seven groups of \\(0.1\\). Therefore\n\\[\n0.7\\div0.1=7=7.0.\n\\]\nThe answer as a decimal is \\(7.0\\).",
